### =========================================================================
### Uji API dengan extension VS Code "REST Client" (Huachao Mao).
### Klik tulisan "Send Request" di atas setiap request.
### Cookie login tersimpan otomatis, jadi jalankan "Login" lebih dulu.
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
# @baseUrl = https://nama-project.vercel.app/api
@deviceKey = isi-sama-dengan-DEVICE_KEY

### ---------- SESSION ----------

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/session
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### Akun yang sedang login
GET {{baseUrl}}/session

### Logout
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/session

### ---------- TENANTS ----------

### Daftar tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants

### Tambah tenant (alokasi arus dalam ampere)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "ESP32-002", "name": "Kopi Senja", "location": "Booth B2", "limitA": 2 }

### Detail tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001

### Naikkan alokasi arus (admin) -> event ALLOC_INCREASED, permintaan tambah arus otomatis selesai
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "limitA": 2.5 }

### Hapus tenant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-002

### ---------- OUTLETS (2 colokan) ----------

### Status kedua colokan
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/outlets

### Nyalakan colokan 1 (boleh pemilik tenant)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/outlets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "ON" }

### Nyalakan colokan 2 (pemilik tenant -> 403, admin -> 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/outlets/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "ON" }

### Matikan colokan 2
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/outlets/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "OFF" }

### ---------- REQUESTS (permintaan tenant ke pengelola) ----------

### Status permintaan
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/requests

### Minta izin colokan 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "outlet2" }

### Minta tambah alokasi arus
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "allocation" }

### Tolak / batalkan permintaan colokan 2
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/requests/outlet2

### ---------- READINGS ----------

### Kirim pembacaan (meniru ESP32): arus total 1,7 A = 85% dari 2 A -> peringatan
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/readings
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}

{ "voltage": 12.02, "current": 1.7, "outlet1": "ON", "outlet2": "ON", "tripped": false }

### Pembacaan 1 jam terakhir
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/readings?limit=20

### ---------- USAGE & EVENTS ----------

### Arus rata-rata & puncak per jam (24 jam terakhir, WIB) + jumlah over-limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/usage?bucket=3600&tz=Asia/Jakarta

### Log kejadian
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/ESP32-001/events?limit=10

### ---------- USERS (admin) ----------

### Daftar akun
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buat akun pemilik tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "budi", "password": "budi123", "name": "Budi (Kopi Senja)", "role": "tenant" }

### Detail akun
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2

### Ganti password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "passwordbaru" }

### Hapus akun
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2
